      "description": "A scene depicting three political figures (Elizabeth Warren, Bernie Sanders, and Cory Booker) in a debate setting, with text overlays emphasizing 'free stuff' as a central theme. The scene is structured as a meme with three panels, each featuring a different politician and text that sarcastically highlights their focus on 'free stuff'. The spatial arrangement is vertical, with each politician occupying a separate panel, and the text is positioned to directly relate to each individual's image.",
